      "writtenOn": "2025-02-13T08:40:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "An unintentionally paused broadcast needs to be monitored.\n\nBefore this CL, it was continuously monitored in a loop, even during scanning. We had to keep it to monitor after stop searching.\n\nNow, if we don’t add it to sync but instead monitor it in onScanResult, we must explicitly add it to the scan when searching stops.",
